{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No limits. No rules. 300 km/h on the Autobahn and through German cities \u2013 pure adrenaline from Munich to Berlin.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Autobahn Racing</i> picks up where the legendary <i>Autobahn Raser</i> series left off \u2013 faster, louder, and more relentless than ever.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience brutal street races on the world\u2019s most famous highway and through authentically recreated German city streets. Only one thing counts: courage, reflexes, and absolute control.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pure Autobahn Action</strong><br>300 km/h on faithfully reconstructed Autobahn sections \u2013 dense traffic, overtakes with inches to spare, always at the limit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>German Cities as Race Tracks</strong><br>Race through meticulously recreated city centers from Munich to Berlin, inspired by real landmarks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Arcade Thrills with Depth</strong><br>Easy to pick up, tough to master \u2013 an addictive arcade racer with modern visuals and precise handling.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Traffic &amp; Police on Your Tail</strong><br>Traffic jams, tailgaters, sirens \u2013 weave through relentless traffic and escape the cops when the lights go on.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cars &amp; Customization</strong><br>Unlock, modify, and customize your cars \u2013 dominate the streets with your style.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1843480?t=1762337744","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1843480/d8e33dcc9db680008d735775a8892d2fabc2d2a7/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1762337744","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1843480/9be5f192503af055e8ee2c2d153d47e1faebe3bc/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762337744","capsule